Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/raspberrypi/openocd

Package: quadrf-openocd
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: OpenOCD build used to program the QuadRF FPGA
 The Raspberry Pi fork of OpenOCD, which supports bit-banging JTAG through the
 RP1 GPIO controller on the Pi 5. Installed under /usr/lib/quadrf/openocd so it
 does not collide with the distribution openocd package.
